# Only the four projects the API needs are copied into the image
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/logs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/TestResults/
.vs/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
LevBakehila/
LevBakehila.Tests/
LevBakehila.Client/
**/node_modules/

# Secrets never go into the image
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Documentation and local working documents
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
